# Clap! Snap! {1}{B} (Adventure, CR 715): "Amass Goblins 2." Bot1 pays it exactly with Mox Jet's {B} and Mox Pearl's {W}: a 2/2 Goblin
# Army token, and the card goes to exile (CR 715.4) to be cast from there as Great Ugly-Looking Goblin {5}{B}, paid exactly with
# Mox Jet, Mox Pearl and two Mana Crypts. "Each creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it has menace": the Army has
# menace; the Goblin itself, with no counter, does not, and Bot2's Memnite, which Gollum's Meager Meal then gives a +1/+1 counter, does
# not either (only creatures Bot1 controls).

